    {
      "text": "星座。[例]星宿、二十八宿",
      "lang": "zh-Hant-TW",
      "register": "dictionary",
      "source_id": "moe-tw-concised-dictionary-2014-20260626",
      "source_entry_id": "3993",
      "verbatim": true
    },
    {
      "text": "1.過夜、居住。[例]露宿、投宿、住宿\n2.舊有的、積久的。[例]宿怨、宿疾\n3.隔夜的。[例]宿雨、宿醉\n4.平常、向來。通「夙」。[例]宿志、宿聞其名",
      "lang": "zh-Hant-TW",
      "register": "dictionary",
